Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `key` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/secrets_expiry/expiring_secret_requires_ownership_and_rejects_loan_escape.jet:11:35
    |
 11 |     _ := vault.ExpiringSecret.new(key, ttl, clock)
    |                                   ^^^
 Why: `key` is a read or write parameter, so its caller keeps the value, and `SigningKey` can't be copied into `ExpiringSecret.new`
 Fix: Declare the parameter `key: &&SigningKey` so the caller hands the value over
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201
